{"version":1,"content":"<p>組合廿四味成員李凱賢（Brian）近日主持HOY訪談節目《九運會客室2》，不過卻被網民直斥其主持功力屬「災難級別」。</p><p>皆因Brian自第一季起便因鏡頭前經常爆粗，加上及欠缺事前準備而備受爭議，豈料新一季開播後其表現未見改善，主持態度再度引發大</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:43:07.035345+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:27:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:18.126911+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:18.126911+00:00","content_hash":"a8c36257a083906b08bb0c91333045d6e7332c6ed4cd1646286ca9bfc1bd7fcd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}